title: Internal Spearphishing from Compromised Account
id: 42c1d064-17aa-48e6-8372-c0d17d6f57fd
status: experimental
description: Detects internal-to-internal emails carrying phishing links or malicious attachments from a legitimate mailbox, indicating a compromised internal account being used to spearphish colleagues.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1534/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    sender_internal: true
    recipient_internal: true
    has_suspicious_link_or_attachment: true
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate internal file sharing
level: high
tags:
  - attack.lateral_movement
  - attack.t1534
